# Repomap — ArkTS struct + decorators detection
#
# Exercises PR-0 extract_arkts. The fixture (PR-0 will provide
# eval/fixtures/testdata/arkts_minimal/) contains the corpus seeds
# from internal/thirdparty/tree-sitter-arkts/corpus/sources/. The
# question forces the analyzer to use repomap to enumerate
# components and their decorators.
#
# PR-0 deliverable: eval/fixtures/testdata/arkts_minimal/ with
# at least Index.ets + UserCard.ets containing @Entry @Component
# struct and @Builder.
#
# Ground truth: at least 2 @Component declarations + 1 @Entry +
# 1 @Builder. Question names them so EXPECT_CONTAINS pins concrete
# symbols rather than vague "ArkTS supports decorators".
ID="arkts_repomap"
NAME="repomap ArkTS @Entry @Component struct + @Builder enumeration"
QUESTION="仓库里有哪些 @Entry 标记的 ArkTS 页面入口，以及哪些 @Builder 复用片段？分别列出文件路径和函数名。"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="@Entry @Component"
EXPECT_SECTIONS="Index.ets"
